2060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Areas of Interest</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 52.7pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 52.7pt; text-align: left;\" width=\"100%\">\n<ol>\n \t<li>C Programming</li>\n \t<li>Web Technologies</li>\n \t<li>Data Structures and Algorithms</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Publication Details</span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">NIL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Honours/Awards/ Achievements</span></strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; b